---
title: Filspresso Next - Authentication Flow Sequence Diagram
---

sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as User Browser
    participant NextJS as Next.js Frontend Port 3000
    participant NestJS as NestJS Backend Port 4000
    participant AuthModule as Auth Module JWT and Session
    participant DB as PostgreSQL accounts and sessions
    participant OPA as OPA Policy Engine Port 8181
    participant Redis as Redis Rate limiting cache

    Note over Browser,Redis: LOGIN FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    NestJS->>AuthModule: validateCredentials(email, password)

    AuthModule->>DB: SELECT * FROM accounts WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>AuthModule: User record (hashed_password, mfa_enabled, role)

    alt Account locked (brute force)
        AuthModule->>DB: Check auth_login_attempts SHA-256 hashed login key
        DB-->>AuthModule: attempt_count, locked_until
        AuthModule-->>NestJS: 429 Too Many Requests (exponential backoff: 30*2^(n-10)s, max 900s)
        NestJS-->>NextJS: 429 error
        NextJS-->>Browser: Show lockout message
    else Password incorrect
        AuthModule->>AuthModule: Argon2id verify (19 MiB, 3 iterations)
        AuthModule->>DB: INSERT login attempt (failed)
        AuthModule-->>NestJS: 401 Unauthorized
        NestJS-->>NextJS: 401 error
        NextJS-->>Browser: Show invalid credentials
    else bcrypt legacy hash detected
        AuthModule->>AuthModule: bcrypt verify (legacy)
        AuthModule->>AuthModule: Rehash with Argon2id
        AuthModule->>DB: UPDATE hashed_password (new Argon2id)
    else Password correct
        AuthModule->>AuthModule: Argon2id verify ✓

        alt MFA enabled
            AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate TOTP challenge
            AuthModule->>DB: Store MFA session state
            AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200 {mfa_required: true}
            NestJS-->>NextJS: 200 {mfa_required: true}
            NextJS-->>Browser: Show MFA input

            Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/auth/mfa/verify {email, totp_code}
            NextJS->>NestJS: POST /auth/mfa/verify
            NestJS->>AuthModule: verifyTOTP(email, totp_code)
            AuthModule->>DB: Validate TOTP (time-window)
            alt TOTP invalid
                AuthModule-->>NestJS: 401 Invalid code
                NestJS-->>NextJS: 401
                NextJS-->>Browser: Show invalid MFA code
            else TOTP valid
                AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate EdDSA JWT (access token, 15min TTL)
                AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate refresh token (HS256, 7d TTL)
                AuthModule->>DB: INSERT INTO user_sessions (session_id, account_id, expires_at)
                AuthModule->>DB: DELETE login attempts
                AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200 {tokens, user}
                NestJS-->>NextJS: Set-Cookie: sid=...
                NextJS-->>Browser: Redirect to /account
            end
        else MFA not enabled
            AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate EdDSA JWT (access token, 15min TTL)
            AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate refresh token (HS256, 7d TTL)
            AuthModule->>DB: INSERT INTO user_sessions (session_id, account_id, expires_at)
            AuthModule->>DB: DELETE login attempts
            AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200 {tokens, user}
            NestJS-->>NextJS: Set-Cookie: sid=...
            NextJS-->>Browser: Redirect to /account
        end
    end

    Note over Browser,Redis: REGISTRATION FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/auth/register {email, password, name}
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /auth/register
    NestJS->>AuthModule: createAccount(data)
    AuthModule->>DB: Check email uniqueness
    alt Email exists
        AuthModule-->>NestJS: 409 Conflict
        NestJS-->>NextJS: 409
        NextJS-->>Browser: Show email already registered
    else Email available
        AuthModule->>AuthModule: Argon2id hash password (19 MiB, 3 iterations)
        AuthModule->>DB: INSERT INTO accounts (email, hashed_password, role='user', theme_preference='light')
        AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate JWT + refresh token
        AuthModule->>DB: INSERT INTO user_sessions
        AuthModule-->>NestJS: 201 {tokens, user}
        NestJS-->>NextJS: Set-Cookie: sid=...
        NextJS-->>Browser: Redirect to /account
    end

    Note over Browser,Redis: GOOGLE/APPLE OAUTH FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: GET /auth/google or /auth/apple
    NextJS->>Browser: Redirect to OAuth provider
    Browser->>Browser: User authenticates with Google/Apple
    Browser->>NextJS: OAuth callback with code
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /auth/oauth/callback {provider, code}
    NestJS->>AuthModule: handleOAuthCallback(provider, code)
    AuthModule->>AuthModule: Exchange code for tokens
    AuthModule->>AuthModule: Fetch user profile from provider
    alt Existing account linked
        AuthModule->>DB: Find account by OAuth ID
        AuthModule->>DB: UPDATE last_login_at
    else New OAuth user
        AuthModule->>DB: INSERT INTO accounts (email, oauth_provider, oauth_id, role='user')
    end
    AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate JWT + refresh token
    AuthModule->>DB: INSERT INTO user_sessions
    AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200 {tokens, user}
    NestJS-->>NextJS: Set-Cookie: sid=...
    NextJS-->>Browser: Redirect to /account

    Note over Browser,Redis: SESSION VALIDATION (per request)

    Browser->>NextJS: Request protected page
    NextJS->>NestJS: Request with Cookie: sid=...
    NestJS->>AuthModule: JWT Guard / Optional JWT Guard
    AuthModule->>DB: SELECT FROM user_sessions WHERE session_id = ? AND expires_at > now()
    alt Session valid
        AuthModule->>OPA: Check policy (user role, resource, action)
        OPA-->>AuthModule: allow/deny
        alt OPA allows
            AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200 {user, permissions}
            NestJS-->>NextJS: Response with data
            NextJS-->>Browser: Render page
        else OPA denies
            AuthModule-->>NestJS: 403 Forbidden
            NestJS-->>NextJS: 403
            NextJS-->>Browser: Show access denied
        end
    else Session expired/invalid
        AuthModule-->>NestJS: 401 Unauthorized
        NestJS-->>NextJS: 401
        NextJS-->>Browser: Redirect to /login
    end

    Note over Browser,Redis: MFA SETUP FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/auth/mfa/setup
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /auth/mfa/setup
    NestJS->>AuthModule: generateMFASecret()
    AuthModule->>AuthModule: Generate TOTP secret (QRCode library)
    AuthModule->>DB: Store encrypted TOTP secret (AES-256-GCM field-level encryption)
    AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200 {secret, qr_code_svg}
    NestJS-->>NextJS: 200
    NextJS-->>Browser: Display QR code

    Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/auth/mfa/activate {totp_code}
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /auth/mfa/activate
    NestJS->>AuthModule: activateMFA(totp_code)
    AuthModule->>DB: Validate TOTP, set mfa_enabled = true
    AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200 {success: true}
    NestJS-->>NextJS: 200
    NextJS-->>Browser: Show MFA enabled confirmation

    Note over Browser,Redis: LOGOUT FLOW

    Browser->>NextJS: POST /api/auth/logout
    NextJS->>NestJS: POST /auth/logout
    NestJS->>AuthModule: logout(session_id)
    AuthModule->>DB: DELETE FROM user_sessions WHERE session_id = ?
    AuthModule-->>NestJS: 200
    NestJS-->>NextJS: Clear-Cookie: sid
    NextJS-->>Browser: Redirect to /


